d":"c-shiji-122-kuli","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p034","quote":"温舒撃東越還，議有不中意者，坐小法抵罪免。是時天子方欲作通天臺而未有人，温舒請覆中尉脱卒，得數萬人作。上説，拜爲少府。徙爲右内史，治如其故，姦邪少禁。坐法失官。復爲右輔，行中尉事。如故操。"}]}},"interpretation_note":"依原文區分授任、貶任與用稱；未明日期保持未知，死亡不自動終止官爵。敘事時長不反推公元年。 原文坐法失官作本次任職終止證據，未明公元年；不推及其他官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji122-074","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","title":"右輔","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p034","quote":"温舒撃東越還，議有不中意者，坐小法抵罪免。是時天子方欲作通天臺而未有人，温舒請覆中尉脱卒，得數萬人作。上説，拜爲少府。徙爲右内史，治如其故，姦邪少禁。坐法失官。復爲右輔，行中尉事。如故操。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji122-074:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p034","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"右輔","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m034-0000","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依原文區分授任、貶任與用稱；未明日期保持未知，死亡不自動終止官爵。敘事時長不反推公元年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-shiji122-009","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","relation":"biographical_origin","place":{"source_name":"陽陵","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p029","quote":"王温舒者，陽陵人也。少時椎埋爲姦。已而試補縣亭長，數廢。爲吏，以治獄至廷史。事張湯，遷爲御史。督盜賊，殺傷甚多，稍遷至廣平都尉。擇郡中豪敢任吏十餘人，以爲爪牙，皆把其陰重罪，而縱使督盜賊，快其意所欲得。此人雖有百罪，弗法；卽有避，因其事夷之，亦滅宗。以其故齊趙之郊盜賊不敢近廣平，廣平聲爲道不拾遺。上聞，遷爲河内太守。"}],"source_term":"陽陵人也","interpretation_note":"人物介紹明示原籍，保留底本原地名；不推現代轄區或出生地，任官所在地另待分類。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p025","text":"趙禹中廢，已而爲廷尉。始條侯以爲禹賊深，弗任。及禹爲少府，比九卿。禹酷急，至晩節，事益多，吏務爲嚴峻，而禹治加緩，而名爲平。王温舒等後起，治酷於禹。禹以老，徙爲燕相。數歳，亂悖有罪，免歸。後湯十餘年，以壽卒于家。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"趙禹","kind":"person","person_id":"vkr_lkp_dme","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"wzy_kri_13n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"vkr_lkp_dme","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"vkr_lkp_dme","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"九卿","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"vkr_lkp_dme","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"vkr_lkp_dme","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"vkr_lkp_dme","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"vkr_lkp_dme","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m025-0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"04o_yps_sg0","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p028","text":"是時趙禹、張湯以深刻爲九卿矣，然其治尚寬，輔法而行，而縱以鷹撃毛摯爲治。後會五銖錢白金起，民爲姦，京師尤甚，乃以縱爲右内史，王温舒爲中尉。温舒至惡，其所爲不先言縱，縱必以氣淩之，敗壞其功。其治，所誅殺甚多，然取爲小治，姦益不勝，直指始出矣。吏之治以斬殺縛束爲務，閻奉以惡用矣。縱廉，其治放郅都。上幸鼎湖，病久，已而卒起幸甘泉，道多不治。上怒曰：「縱以我爲不復行此道乎？」嗛之。至冬，楊可方受告緡，縱以爲此亂民，部吏捕其爲可使者。天子聞，使杜式治，以爲廢格沮事，棄縱市。後一歳，張湯亦死。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"趙禹","kind":"person","person_id":"vkr_lkp_dme","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"張湯","kind":"person","person_id":"04o_yps_sg0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"閻奉","kind":"person","person_id":"0xp_j8o_cl2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0138","start":138,"end":139,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"郅都","kind":"person","person_id":"rbv_387_iwe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0147","start":147,"end":148,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0168","start":168,"end":169,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0173","start":173,"end":174,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0191","start":191,"end":193,"surface":"楊可","kind":"person","person_id":"uxr_e45_mz7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0198","start":198,"end":199,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0210","start":210,"end":213,"surface":"可使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0214","start":214,"end":216,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0219","start":219,"end":221,"surface":"杜式","kind":"person","person_id":"blc_s9z_o1j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0231","start":231,"end":232,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m028-0238","start":238,"end":240,"surface":"張湯","kind":"person","person_id":"04o_yps_sg0","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p029","text":"王温舒者，陽陵人也。少時椎埋爲姦。已而試補縣亭長，數廢。爲吏，以治獄至廷史。事張湯，遷爲御史。督盜賊，殺傷甚多，稍遷至廣平都尉。擇郡中豪敢任吏十餘人，以爲爪牙，皆把其陰重罪，而縱使督盜賊，快其意所欲得。此人雖有百罪，弗法；卽有避，因其事夷之，亦滅宗。以其故齊趙之郊盜賊不敢近廣平，廣平聲爲道不拾遺。上聞，遷爲河内太守。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m029-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m029-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"張湯","kind":"person","person_id":"04o_yps_sg0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m029-0067","start":67,"end":71,"surface":"豪敢任吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m029-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"爪牙","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m029-0149","start":149,"end":150,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p030","text":"素居廣平時，皆知河内豪姦之家，及往，九月而至。令郡具私馬五十匹，爲驛自河内至長安，部吏如居廣平時方略，捕郡中豪猾，郡中豪猾相連坐千餘家。上書請，大者至族，小者乃死，家盡沒入償臧。奏行不過二三日，得可事。論報，至流血十餘里。河内皆怪其奏，以爲神速。盡十二月，郡中毋聲，毋敢夜行，野無犬吠之盜。其頗不得，失之旁郡國，黎來，會春，温舒頓足嘆曰：「嗟乎，令冬月益展一月，足吾事矣！」其好殺伐行威不愛人如此。天子聞之，以爲能，遷爲中尉。其治復放河内，徙諸名禍猾吏與從事，河内則楊皆、麻戊，關中楊贛、成信等。義縱爲内史，憚未敢恣治。及縱死，張湯敗後，徙爲廷尉，而尹齊爲中尉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0052","start":52,"end":56,"surface":"郡中豪猾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0057","start":57,"end":61,"surface":"郡中豪猾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"千餘家","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0199","start":199,"end":201,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0222","start":222,"end":226,"surface":"名禍猾吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"楊皆","kind":"person","person_id":"i94_cco_pt9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0236","start":236,"end":238,"surface":"麻戊","kind":"person","person_id":"jfj_ky5_9lg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0241","start":241,"end":243,"surface":"楊贛","kind":"person","person_id":"syj_umb_ll5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0244","start":244,"end":246,"surface":"成信","kind":"person","person_id":"gbb_0p6_20p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0248","start":248,"end":250,"surface":"義縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0261","start":261,"end":262,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0264","start":264,"end":266,"surface":"張湯","kind":"person","person_id":"04o_yps_sg0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m030-0275","start":275,"end":277,"surface":"尹齊","kind":"person","person_id":"m6r_c9h_kjq","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p031","text":"尹齊者，東郡茌平人。以刀筆稍遷至御史。事張湯，張湯數稱以爲廉武，使督盜賊，所斬伐不避貴戚。遷爲關内都尉，聲甚於寧成。上以爲能，遷爲中尉，吏民益凋敝。尹齊木彊少文，豪惡吏伏匿而善吏不能爲治，以故事多廢，抵罪。上復徙温舒爲中尉，而楊仆以嚴酷爲主爵都尉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"尹齊","kind":"person","person_id":"m6r_c9h_kjq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"張湯","kind":"person","person_id":"04o_yps_sg0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"張湯","kind":"person","person_id":"04o_yps_sg0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"寧成","kind":"person","person_id":"9u9_ae0_0oz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"尹齊","kind":"person","person_id":"m6r_c9h_kjq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0081","start":81,"end":84,"surface":"豪惡吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"善吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0103","start":103,"end":104,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m031-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"楊仆","kind":"person","person_id":"jk8_8gt_vmi","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p033","text":"而温舒復爲中尉。爲人少文，居廷惛惛不辯，至於中尉則心開。督盜賊，素習關中俗，知豪惡吏，豪惡吏盡復爲用，爲方略。吏苛察，盜賊惡少年投缿購告言姦，置伯格長以牧司姦盜賊。温舒爲人讇善事有埶者；卽無埶者，視之如奴。有埶家，雖有姦如山，弗犯；無埶者，貴戚必侵辱。舞文巧詆下戸之猾，以熏大豪。其治中尉如此。姦猾窮治，大抵盡靡爛獄中，行論無出者。其爪牙吏虎而冠。於是中尉部中中猾以下皆伏，有勢者爲游聲譽，稱治。治數歳，其吏多以權富。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m033-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m033-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"豪惡吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m033-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"豪惡吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m033-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m033-0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"有埶家","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m033-0167","start":167,"end":170,"surface":"爪牙吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m033-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"其吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p034","text":"温舒撃東越還，議有不中意者，坐小法抵罪免。是時天子方欲作通天臺而未有人，温舒請覆中尉脱卒，得數萬人作。上説，拜爲少府。徙爲右内史，治如其故，姦邪少禁。坐法失官。復爲右輔，行中尉事。如故操。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m034-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m034-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m034-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m034-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p035","text":"歳餘，會宛軍發，詔徴豪吏，温舒匿其吏華成，及人有變告温舒受員騎錢，他姦利事，罪至族，自殺。其時兩弟及兩婚家亦各自坐他罪而族。光祿徐自爲曰：「悲夫，夫古有三族，而王温舒罪至同時而五族乎！」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m035-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m035-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"華成","kind":"person","person_id":"eht_523_crr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m035-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m035-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"兩弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m035-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"兩婚家","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m035-0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"徐自爲","kind":"person","person_id":"q31_96y_x3u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m035-0080","start":80,"end":83,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p036","text":"温舒死，家直累千金。後數歳，尹齊亦以淮陽都尉病死，家直不滿五十金。所誅滅淮陽甚多，及死，仇家欲燒其尸，尸亡去歸葬。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m036-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m036-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"尹齊","kind":"person","person_id":"m6r_c9h_kjq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m036-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"仇家","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p037","text":"自温舒等以惡爲治，而郡守、都尉、諸侯二千石欲爲治者，其治大抵盡放温舒，而吏民益輕犯法，盜賊滋起。南陽有梅免、白政，楚有殷中、杜少，齊有徐勃，燕趙之閒有堅盧、范生之屬。大群至數千人，擅自號，攻城邑，取庫兵，釋死罪，縛辱郡太守、都尉，殺二千石，爲檄告縣趣具食；小群以百數，掠鹵鄕里者，不可勝數也。於是天子始使御史中丞、丞相長史督之。猶弗能禁也，乃使光祿大夫范昆、諸輔都尉及故九卿張德等衣繡衣，持節，虎符發兵以興撃，斬首大部或至萬餘級，及以法誅通飲食，坐連諸郡，甚者數千人。數歳，乃頗得其渠率。散卒失亡，復聚黨阻山川者，往往而群居，無可柰何。於是作「沈命法」，曰群盜起不發覺，發覺而捕弗滿品者，二千石以下至小吏主者皆死。其後小吏畏誅，雖有盜不敢發，恐不能得，坐課累府，府亦使其不言。故盜賊寖多，上下相爲匿，以文辭避法焉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"郡守","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"都尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"梅免","kind":"person","person_id":"vws_wz0_hsv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"白政","kind":"person","person_id":"438_hqd_ydb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"殷中","kind":"person","person_id":"xuq_4z2_6go","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"杜少","kind":"person","person_id":"zlv_jok_rba","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"徐勃","kind":"person","person_id":"lry_byk_0kt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"堅盧","kind":"person","person_id":"8ej_u7b_qpl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"范生","kind":"person","person_id":"tem_nwk_wxr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0108","start":108,"end":111,"surface":"郡太守","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"都尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0148","start":148,"end":150,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0152","start":152,"end":156,"surface":"御史中丞","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0157","start":157,"end":161,"surface":"丞相長史","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"范昆","kind":"person","person_id":"gt5_z7w_98q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0179","start":179,"end":183,"surface":"諸輔都尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0187","start":187,"end":189,"surface":"張德","kind":"person","person_id":"e68_is8_v7x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0278","start":278,"end":280,"surface":"群盜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0300","start":300,"end":302,"surface":"小吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m037-0309","start":309,"end":311,"surface":"小吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p038","text":"減宣者，楊人也。以佐史無害給事河東守府。衞將軍靑使買馬河東，見宣無害，言上，徴爲大廐丞。官事辨，稍遷至御史及中丞。使治主父偃及治淮南反獄，所以微文深詆，殺者甚衆，稱爲敢決疑。數廢數起，爲御史及中丞者幾二十歳。王温舒免中尉，而宣爲左内史。其治米鹽，事大小皆關其手，自部署縣名曹實物，官吏令丞不得擅搖，痛以重法繩之。居官數年，一切郡中爲小治辨，然獨宣以小致大，能因力行之，難以爲經。中廢。爲右扶風，坐怨成信，信亡藏上林中，宣使郿令格殺信，吏卒格信時，射中上林苑門，宣下吏詆罪，以爲大逆，當族，自殺。而杜周任用。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"減宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0020","start":20,"end":24,"surface":"衞將軍靑","kind":"person","person_id":"up1_nzr_gq1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0059","start":59,"end":62,"surface":"主父偃","kind":"person","person_id":"h37_ncd_om5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0104","start":104,"end":107,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0140","start":140,"end":144,"surface":"官吏令丞","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0172","start":172,"end":173,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0199","start":199,"end":201,"surface":"成信","kind":"person","person_id":"gbb_0p6_20p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0202","start":202,"end":203,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"gbb_0p6_20p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0209","start":209,"end":210,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0211","start":211,"end":213,"surface":"郿令","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0215","start":215,"end":216,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"gbb_0p6_20p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0217","start":217,"end":219,"surface":"吏卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0220","start":220,"end":221,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"gbb_0p6_20p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0230","start":230,"end":231,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0248","start":248,"end":250,"surface":"杜周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p042","text":"周中廢，後爲執金時，逐盜，捕治桑弘羊、衞皇后昆弟子刻深，天子以爲盡力無私，遷爲御史大夫。家兩子，夾河爲守。其治暴酷皆甚於王温舒等矣。杜周初徴爲廷史，有一馬，且不全；及身久任事，至三公列，子孫尊官，家訾累數巨萬矣。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"桑弘羊","kind":"person","person_id":"zb7_1f5_mzb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0019-person","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"衞皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"52y_wzf_jzz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0019","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"昆弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"兩子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0060","start":60,"end":63,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"杜周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"子孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-122","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli","source":{"title":"史記／卷122","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷122","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷122&oldid=7904124","revision_id":7904124,"accessed_on":"2026-10-